sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Interior Designer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CompanyPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>ViewCompanyBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>ViewCompanyController
  participant DesignerCompany as «entity»<br/>DesignerCompany
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: view my company information
  UI->>B: GET /api/designer/company (JWT)
  B->>C: view(Integer designerId)
  C->>DesignerCompany: findByDesigner()
  DesignerCompany->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>DesignerCompany: rows
  DesignerCompany-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CompanyResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result